      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOPE'S JACKY (6) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from nine starts. In the money last time at this track (21.89) in a Grade 5, finishing a 3.5 lengths second. Makes strong appeal on best. BROTHER SAM (1) has been out of the placings at his last two starts but prior to that posted a superb 19.70 win over 366m at Capalaba. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form. FAST FELIX (2) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at eight of 21 starts including six wins but missed the frame latest when fourth (22.00) over 390m at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. SWEET LADETTE (8) hit the frame latest (21.99) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Has already won three times from this draw.",
